  "description": "Use shared AI contracts in middleware, RAG integrations and custom providers without depending on provider SDKs. Defines IAIService, optional Run/request-feature/image interfaces, messages, streaming events, tools, typed image options, AIRunResult, processing-speed choices and observations, and immutable model-capability snapshots. Includes shared identifiers for GPT-6 Sol/Luna, Claude Opus 5.5, Grok 4.7 and DeepSeek V4 Pro, plus Perplexity Agent API contracts. Provider execution is supplied by Mythosia.AI 8.1.0. What's New in v4.1.0: additional model identifiers and optional processing-speed contracts. Depends only on the lightweight Mythosia base package.",
