  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v4.1.0 adds GPT-6 Sol/Luna, Claude Opus 5.5, Grok 4.7 and DeepSeek V4 Pro identifiers, Gpt6Reasoning.None, and optional processing-speed request, capability and observation contracts. Existing required interface members, constructors and enum values are retained. Mythosia.AI 8.1.0 supplies provider validation and execution. Recognizes explicit xAI input-too-large context errors without treating unrelated failures as compaction signals. Full notes: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI/blob/main/src/core/Mythosia.AI.Abstractions/RELEASE_NOTES.md#v410",
